1
00:00:00,108 --> 00:00:03,588
(Q11（单选）) Good morning and welcome again to Your City Today.

2
00:00:03,588 --> 00:00:08,710
With me today is Graham Campbell, a councillor from the city council.

3
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:14,063
He will be telling us about the plan to improve the fast-growing suburb of Red Hill.

4
00:00:14,063 --> 00:00:16,198
Good morning Graham and welcome to the show.

5
00:00:16,198 --> 00:00:17,163
Good morning, Carol.

6
00:00:17,163 --> 00:00:23,407
Now, Graham, I understand that there has been a lot of community consultation for the new plan?

7
00:00:23,407 --> 00:00:27,824
Yes, we've tried to address some of the concerns that local groups told us about.

8
00:00:27,824 --> 00:00:35,915
People we've heard from are mainly worried about traffic in the area, and, in particular, the increasing speed of cars near schools.

9
00:00:35,915 --> 00:00:41,842
[Q11答案句] They feel that it is only a matter of time before there is an accident as a lot of the children walk to the school.

10
00:00:41,842 --> 00:00:48,997
(Q12) So we're trying to do something about that. Another area of concern is the overhead power lines.

11
00:00:48,997 --> 00:00:54,872
These are very old and a lot of people we spoke to asked if something could be done about them.

12
00:00:54,872 --> 00:01:03,691
[Q12答案句] Well, I'm happy to report that the power company have agreed to move the power lines underground at a cost of $800,000.

13
00:01:03,691 --> 00:01:08,057
I think that will really improve the look of the area, as well as being safer.

14
00:01:08,057 --> 00:01:14,541
(Q13) That's good to know, but will that mean an increase in rates for the local businesses in that area?

15
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:21,059
[Q13答案句] Well, the power company have agreed to bear the cost of this themselves after a lot of discussion with the council.

16
00:01:21,059 --> 00:01:29,483
[Q13干扰项⭕️] This is wonderful news as the council now has some extra funds for us to put into other things like tree planting and art work.

17
00:01:29,483 --> 00:01:34,767
(Q14（地图）) Now, we've also put together a map which we've sent out to all the residents in the area.

18
00:01:34,767 --> 00:01:37,928
And on the map we've marked the proposed changes.

19
00:01:37,928 --> 00:01:45,259
Firstly, we'll plant mature pine trees to provide shelter and shade just to the right of the supermarket in Days Road.

20
00:01:45,259 --> 00:01:52,389
(Q15) In order to address the traffic problems, the pavements on the corner of Carberry and Thomas Street will be widened.

21
00:01:52,389 --> 00:01:56,823
This will help to reduce the speed of vehicles entering Thomas Street.

22
00:01:56,823 --> 00:02:01,677
(Q16) We think it's very important to separate the local residential streets from the main road.

23
00:02:01,677 --> 00:02:07,171
So the roadway at the entry of Thomas Street from Days Road will be painted red.

24
00:02:07,171 --> 00:02:12,193
This should mark it more clearly and act as a signal for traffic to slow down.

25
00:02:12,193 --> 00:02:17,980
(Q17) One way of making sure that the pedestrians are safe is to increase signage at the intersections.

26
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:26,081
A 'keep clear' sign will be erected at the junction of Evelyn Street and Hill Street, to enable traffic to exit at all times.&nbsp;

27
00:02:26,081 --> 00:02:35,419
(Q18) Something we're planning to do to help control the flow of traffic in the area is to install traffic lights half way down Hill Street where it crosses Days Road.

28
00:02:35,419 --> 00:02:42,102
(Q19) Now, we haven't only thought about the cars and traffic, of course, there's also something for the children.

29
00:02:42,102 --> 00:02:56,502
We're going to get school children in the area to research a local story, the life of a local sports hero perhaps, and an artist will incorporate that story into paintings on the wall of a building on the other side of Hill Street from the supermarket.

30
00:02:56,502 --> 00:03:05,227
(Q20) And finally, we've agreed to build a new children's playground which will be at the other end of Hill Street close to the intersection with Carberry Street.

31
00:03:05,227 --> 00:03:09,292
Wonderful, now, what's the next stage?

32
00:03:09,292 --> 00:03:11,792
Well, the final plan...

